# The Elves and the Shoemaker. A story for Leo.

[stop music fade=6]
[bed amb fire size=0.3 vol=-14 fade=3]
[bed clock clock rate=1 pitch=2100 room=room wet=0.4 vol=-22 fade=4 duck=2]
